## 14. Connection Best Practices

```sql
-- ✅ ALWAYS use sslmode=verify-full for CockroachDB Cloud
-- postgresql://user:pass@host:26257/db?sslmode=verify-full

-- ✅ Connection pool sizing: 4 × number_of_cpus per application instance
-- ✅ Idle timeout: 5-10 minutes
-- ✅ Max lifetime: 30 minutes (rotate connections)
-- ✅ CockroachDB Cloud Serverless includes built-in connection pooling
-- ✅ For Dedicated/Self-Hosted: use PgBouncer in transaction mode or driver-level pooling
```

